        "original_id": "4d87bfde-90e1-5774-aa50-6b8248dc567f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Wedding Bell Blues, Gilmore Girls, Tuck Everlasting, Sin City, Post Grad, The Sisterhood of the Traveling Pants film series\n- People: Alexis Bledel, Lorelai Gilmore, Rory Gilmore, Lauren Graham, Winnie Foster, Lena Kaligaris\n- Topics: television episodes, acting careers\n\nFacts:\n- \"Wedding Bell Blues\" is the thirteenth episode of the fifth season of the American comedy-drama series \"Gilmore Girls\" and the 100th episode of the show overall.\n- In \"Wedding Bell Blues,\" Lorelai Gilmore is played by Lauren Graham and Rory Gilmore serves as best man while Lorelai serves as maid of honor.\n- Kimberly Alexis Bledel was born on September 16, 1981, and she is an American actress and model.\n- Alexis Bledel made her feature film debut as Winnie Foster in \"Tuck Everlasting\" in 2002.\n- Alexis Bledel later appeared in \"Sin City\" in 2005 and \"Post Grad\" in 2009.\n- Alexis Bledel also played Lena Kaligaris in \"The Sisterhood of the Traveling Pants\" film series.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
